e plant, demand observability, verify stability, respect bounds, decouple harm, coordinate benefits, and close the loop before declaring success. Use when designing architecture, writing complex code, refactoring coupled modules, debugging non-deterministic systems, or any task where \"correct AND robust\" cannot be verified by a single happy path.", "downloads": 0, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_4c78dbc7/skill-systems-thinking", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a00e31c7-8d6a-4e65-84fc-16a177f95674.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "systems-thinking", "namespace": {"canonicalName": "@user_4c78dbc7/skill-systems-thinking", "displayName": "user_4c78dbc7", "handle": "user_4c78dbc7", "publicSlug": "skill-systems-thinking"}, "ownerName": "user_4c78dbc7", "score": 0, "slug": "skill-systems-thinking", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "dev-code-gen", "name": "代码生成"}, {"key": "dev-script", "name": "脚本工具"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1784947903275, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "professional", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1784946680735, "description": "使用目录内置 Python 和真实 Baostock 手动执行 A 股市场研究、股票池构建、日报排名、历史查询及明确触发的推荐验证研究。适用于指定交易日运行、最近完整交易日解析、结果审计和报告生成；不执行交易、自动调度或生产部署。", "description_zh": "使用目录内置 Python 和真实 Baostock 手动执行 A 股市场研究、股票池构建、日报排名、历史查询及明确触发的推荐验证研究。适用于指定交易日运行、最近完整交易日解析、结果审计和报告生成；不执行交易、自动调度或生产部署。", "downloads": 0, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_a838be1f/grjrfx-zs", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7920727c-4e7d-496a-9223-d9c6673e9e53.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "个人金融分析助手", "namespace": {"canonicalName": "@user_a838be1f/grjrfx-zs", "displayName": "user